{{also|crás}}
==Latin==

===Etymology===
From the adverbial root *ka-, *ku- ("to lighten, burn"); cf. {{etyl|grc|-}} {{m|grc|καίω}}, {{etyl|sa|-}} {{m|sa|tr=cvas}}, Persian {{m|fa|سو|tr=su||light}}.

===Adverb===
{{la-adv|cras|crās|-}}

# [[tomorrow]]
#: '''''Crās''' Mārcus lūdōs vidēbit.''
#:: '''Tomorrow''', Marcus will see the games.

====Derived terms====
